      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create stream_completion.py in the current working directory.\nTask: streams partial output tokens from a hosted LLM.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b984cbff001WsH3c65hMjC7YA",
