    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing the Provider**\n\nI'm currently focused on selecting the appropriate external provider for streaming partial output tokens from a hosted LLM. I've decided to proceed with Google Cloud's `google-cloud-aiplatform` library, and I'll ensure its identifier is correctly integrated into the `stream_completion.py` file. Vertex AI will be the specific platform I'm using.\n\n\n**Defining the Workflow**\n\nNow, I'm solidifying the workflow for `stream_completion.py`. The core will be using Google Cloud's Vertex AI. I'll initialize the client and generative model, then call `stream_generate_content`. Iterating and printing the partial tokens will complete the process. This file needs to be built to stream partial output tokens from a hosted LLM.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789818886498,
          "start": 1789818884547
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b984d1c3001Nvhz7NtBs4tZxh",
      "message_id": "msg_0b984cc03001yBatAdVW09GDK3",
      "session_id": "ses_f467b3410ffe5NCn9siBGO4pMO",
      "time_created": 1789818884547,
      "time_updated": 1789818886499
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "Umv9RA0dUROkWOvs",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "import google.cloud.aiplatform as aiplatform\n\ndef stream_completion(project_id: str, location: str, model_name: str, prompt: str):\n    aiplatform.init(project=project_id, location=location)\n    model = aiplatform.preview.language_models.ChatModel.from_pretrained(model_name)\n\n    responses = model.stream_send_message(content=prompt)\n    for response in responses:\n        print(response.text, end=\"\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    # Replace with your Google Cloud project ID and desired location\n    PROJECT_ID = \"your-gcp-project-id\" \n    LOCATION = \"us-central1\"  # e.g., \"us-central1\"\n    MODEL_NAME = \"chat-bison@001\"  # or another suitable model like \"gemini-pro\"\n    USER_PROMPT = \"Write a short story about a robot who learns to love.\"\n\n    print(f\"Streaming completion from model {MODEL_NAME} in project {PROJECT_ID}, location {LOCATION}:\")\n    stream_completion(PROJECT_ID, LOCATION, MODEL_NAME, USER_PROMPT)\n",
            "filePath": "stream_completion.py"
          },
          "metadata": {
